'''Tahnti Park''' (Japanese: '''タンティ{{tt|公園|こうえん}}''' ''Tahnti Park'') is a park home to various species of Pokémon located in the downtown of [[Ryme City]] southeast of the [[Central Square|central square]] in the game {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|video game}}. The second part of Chapter 1 takes place here.

The park is divided into three areas: the fountain area in the center, the nature area to the west, and the café area to the east.

